{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0283_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "4bb9db2c3674db9c8a72a29fc6d83f25d71fe3eafba16fef3e1488a4167b75ce", "ja": "はいっ！　今回のライブ、水着だった\nじゃないですか。その、お腹とかも出る感じの……。", "zh": "是的！这次的演唱会不是穿了泳装嘛。就是那种会露出肚子的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0283_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "2e2bdaebf5c114e088681553604023e4e658104dd77232d79e7365114f0e102d", "ja": "だから、ちゃんと似合うように、\nお菓子の食べ過ぎに気を付けてたんです！", "zh": "所以，为了穿起来好看，我一直注意没有吃太多点心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
